1
00:00:11,433 --> 00:00:17,572
Somebody is on the way to this job right
now. The question a client is about to ask

2
00:00:17,572 --> 00:00:19,421
is how far away they are.

3
00:00:19,873 --> 00:00:26,760
The job answers it: this is the road they
have taken, point by point, as the phone

4
00:00:26,760 --> 00:00:27,768
reported it.

5
00:00:28,218 --> 00:00:34,135
Not a straight line between two pins. The
bends are there because the van went round

6
00:00:34,135 --> 00:00:34,487
them.

7
00:00:34,938 --> 00:00:41,362
Which gives the job a distance and a time
that nobody had to write down, and nobody

8
00:00:41,362 --> 00:00:42,601
can misremember.

9
00:00:43,052 --> 00:00:48,620
It starts when they set off and stops when
they arrive. Not all day, and never when

10
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:49,693
there is no job.

11
00:00:50,145 --> 00:00:54,928
And who is where right now is the first
thing on the screen everybody opens anyway.

